            <section id="bio">
                <h1>Aaron <span class="highlight">James</span> Grando</h1>
                <h2>Technologist &nbsp; · &nbsp; Product Manager &nbsp; · &nbsp; AI Strategist &nbsp; · &nbsp;  Creative Agency Veteran</h2> 
                <p>
                    Hey, I'm Aaron. For the last <%= (Time.now.year-2010).humanize %> years I've been building tech-forward digital creative for some of the world’s most unforgettable consumer brands at <a href="https://rtop.com/" target="_blank">RTO+P</a> / <a href="https://www.modop.com/" target="_blank">Mod Op</a>, in always-sunny Philadelphia, PA. 
                    <br />
                    <br />
                    In 2025, I became a founding member of Mod Op's <a href="https://www.modop.com/press/mod-op-builds-on-5m-ai-investment-with-new-innovations-team-and-proprietary-ai-solutions/" target="_blank">Innovations 
                    Team</a> and assumed a new product leadership role as VP, Creative Innovation – responsible for translating frontier AI technology into new agency capabilities and concepts that make teams faster, smarter and more creative.
                </p> 
