            <section id="what-im-building">
                <h3>What I'm Building</h3>
                <p>
                    <strong>Mod Chat</strong> In-house LLM chat interface with advanced tool calling and retreival capabilities.
                    <br />
                    <span class="fun-fact">Providing the team with the latest AI models and tools.</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Brand Agents</strong> Brand-aligned AI agents that support agency teams, clients, and apps.
                    <br />
                    <span class="fun-fact">100+ client and prospect Brand Agents deployed and in use.</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Nexus</strong> Context Collaboration Platform for Mod Op's app ecosystem.
                    <br />
                    <span class="fun-fact">Responsible and secure org-wide AI context engineering and visibility.</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Mod Heat</strong> Audience-aware realtime trend tracker and idea factory, powered by Brand Agents.
                    <br />
                    <span class="fun-fact">Using AI to perform a task too dangerous for humans: staying on top of the news.</span>
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong>Audience Lab</strong> Synthetic audience modeling and creative pretesting grounded with real human data.
                    <br />
                    <span class="fun-fact">Strategic toolkit for understanding and engaging brand audiences.</span>
                </p>
